{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"63cd07ce36c477e5cdbb80c64741c8474a54e9ed191c5556dc8bc8fcb8c26092","digest":{"component_or_area":"release workflow and Hatchling build hook","key_entities":["hatch_build.py","src/rebar/_build_info.py","src/rebar/signing.py",".github/workflows/release.yml",".github/workflows/test.yml","tests/unit/test_attestation_signing.py","tests/unit/test_build_provenance.py","docs/releasing.md","REBAR_BUILD_COMMIT","COMMIT","_resolve_build_commit","SHA256SUMS"],"problem_keywords":["build-once artifact identity","provenance","wheel-from-sdist","commit baking","reproducible builds","release pipeline","artifact testing"],"propositions":["The release wheel built from extracted sdist carries COMMIT=None instead of the short commit SHA because the hook re-runs in the sdist extraction context where .git is absent and REBAR_BUILD_COMMIT is unset.","The current test suite does not catch the wheel-from-sdist defect because test_attestation_signing.py builds a WheelBuilder directly against the checkout, bypassing the failing sdist→wheel path.","The build, test, and publish jobs in release.yml follow different artifact paths (build has no functional test, test.yml installs from source tree with .git present, publish rebuilds), so the exact published wheel is never validated before PyPI upload.","The hook must resolve the commit via a four-step precedence (REBAR_BUILD_COMMIT env var, preserve existing non-null COMMIT in _build_info.py, git rev-parse --short HEAD, None) to support both release builds and install-from-sdist without overwriting the baked SHA.","The _build_info.py file must be shipped in the sdist via force_include so install-from-sdist can preserve the baked commit value rather than overwriting it with None when the hook re-runs in the extracted tree.","The release workflow must build once, record SHA-256 digests, test the exact wheel and sdist artifacts in clean environments, and publish without rebuilding, with hash verification before PyPI upload."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785820178720093779,"uuid":"5693959c-106b-410e-9ac1-59ed4c3eb462"}